CORE
main.cob

^EXIT=10$
^\[cobol:subscript-range\.\d+\].*: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
I7: a subscript into an OCCURS DEPENDING ON table is bounded by the run-time
DEPENDING value, so 4 is out of range when the current length is 3 even though
4 <= the maximum of 5. IBM LR "OCCURS clause" format 2.
